---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout lang="en" title="Activation and subscriptions" description="Activation information for Homi applications.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">Activation support</span><h1>Activation and subscriptions</h1><p class="lead">Subscriptions are managed directly with the Homi team. Customers do not need to create an account or provide an email address.</p></div></section>
  <section class="content"><div class="container content-narrow">
    <h2>How activation works</h2><ol><li>Create an activation request from the application.</li><li>Share the request reference or exported request file with support.</li><li>The team reviews the device and subscription details.</li><li>For paid plans, the team confirms receipt of payment before issuing or extending a license.</li><li>Import the signed license file into the application. Local verification does not require an internet connection.</li></ol>
    <div class="notice">Subscription prices are not published on this website. Contact the team for current terms.</div>
    <h2>Subscription terms</h2><ul><li>Monthly: 30 days.</li><li>Annual: 365 days.</li><li>Lifetime: use of the purchased application version; future updates and support are separate services.</li></ul>
    <h2>Contact support</h2><p><a class="button button-primary" href="tel:+2490904697455">+249 090 469 7455</a></p>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
